Package: strmatch
Title: Tools for String Matching and Text Standardization
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Alvis", "Lee", , "alee134@u.rochester.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package provides tools for identifying, matching and standardizing 
  string data in R. The package includes functions for summarizing frequencies of 
  unique string values (str_match), locating target words or patterns within data (str_find), 
  and matching inconsistent strings against a user-supplied dictionary for 
  standardization (str_clean.These functions are designed to support exploratory 
  data analysis and preprocessing workflows with text-based data.
